<title>USA: American Banknote to buy Menno cards unit.</title>
<headline>American Banknote to buy Menno cards unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Banknote Corp said on Friday it agreed to acquire the plastic cards division of Menno Equipamentos para Escritorio for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Menno, of Brazil, had financial-transaction card sales totaling 14 million reais in 1996, American Banknote said.</p>
<p>American Banknote provides secure transaction documents and systems.</p>
</text>
